/Title (Q: Why are AI and Utility sectors outperforming while the Bitcoin ecosystem remains under pressure? A: There is a clear rotation toward narrative-driven growth and infrastructure. The 6.49% gain in the AI sector reflects sustained demand for technology-linked assets despite macro headwinds. Conversely, the -4.47% drag in the Bitcoin ecosystem indicates a lack of immediate catalysts or "ecosystem fatigue," as capital prioritizes sectors with higher immediate utility or technological momentum)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 902 0 R
/Prev 1106 0 R
/Next 1199 0 R
>>
endobj
